# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/lá
# (irregular m.: genitive "lae", plural "laethanta").
# "lá" begins with a consonant the modern standard spells no lenition on, so
# the counted phrase shows the radical throughout: "ar feadh trí lá" (for
# three days) is the attested worked example on en.wiktionary.org "ar feadh".
lá
lae
laethanta
